Package: godeb-play
Version: 0.1.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: ZeroDos1988 <336650567+ZeroDos1988@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ZeroDos1988/godeb-play
Depends: libc6, adduser, systemd, ufw, wireguard-tools, qrencode, fail2ban
Description: Game server panel that joins a GoDeb hub over WireGuard
 GoDeb Play is a small web panel for game servers on a home server
 (container or VM). It joins a GoDeb hub as a site over WireGuard, so the
 game servers are reachable through the hub's public IP without port
 forwarding on the home router. Login with mandatory TOTP, privileged steps
 in a separate root agent.
